: {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx390\", \"category\": \"outdoor\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-obx390.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 600, \"highPrice\": 5000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx390\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"3.91mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"7,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"256 x 128 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness of the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display offers a peak brightness of 7,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility even under direct sunlight typical in the Gulf region.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm suitable for extreme weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the product features an IP65 rating for both front and rear, providing robust protection against dust and water ingress, and is tested to withstand wind loads up to 120 km/h.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this outdoor LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display panels measure 960 x 960 mm and weigh 28 kg each, designed for rear service access to facilitate easier installation and maintenance on building facades and highways.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm compare to other outdoor LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to alternatives, it offers superior brightness (7,000 nits) and weather resistance (IP65 F&R), along with advanced thermal management for reliable operation in harsh GCC climates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical lifespan of this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The product boasts up to 100,000 operational hours, ensuring long-term durability and a strong return on investment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the average power consumption of the display per square meter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It consumes an average power of 520W per square meter, balancing high brightness with energy efficiency.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty offered with the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Warranty terms vary; please contact Brightluxx sales for detailed information on coverage and duration specific to your purchase.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which applications are best suited for this LED display product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display excels in outdoor environments such as building facades and highway digital out-of-home (DOOH) advertising, due to its high visibility and durability.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx390\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm</h1><p>Brightluxx offers Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm LED display for vivid visuals across UAE. Perfect for outdoor advertising. Get a quote today!</p><p><strong>Maximum visibility under direct sunlight.</strong></p><p>Designed for the Gulf region's extreme conditions. IP65 front and rear protection, 7,000-nit peak brightness, and advanced thermal management ensure flawless performance from Riyadh to Dubai.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the brightness of the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm LED display?</h3><p>The display offers a peak brightness of 7,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility even under direct sunlight typical in the Gulf region.</p><h3>Is the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm suitable for extreme weather conditions?</h3><p>Yes, the product features an IP65 rating for both front and rear, providing robust protection against dust and water ingress, and is tested to withstand wind loads up to 120 km/h.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this outdoor LED display?</h3><p>The display panels measure 960 x 960 mm and weigh 28 kg each, designed for rear service access to facilitate easier installation and maintenance on building facades and highways.</p><h3>How does the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm compare to other outdoor LED displays?</h3><p>Compared to alternatives, it offers superior brightness (7,000 nits) and weather resistance (IP65 F&amp;R), along with advanced thermal management for reliable operation in harsh GCC climates.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm