 \"3.91mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"7,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"256 x 128 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:T9ae,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness of the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display offers a peak brightness of 7,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility even under direct sunlight typical in the Gulf region.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm suitable for extreme weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the product features an IP65 rating for both front and rear, providing robust protection against dust and water ingress, and is tested to withstand wind loads up to 120 km/h.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this outdoor LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display panels measure 960 x 960 mm and weigh 28 kg each, designed for rear service access to facilitate easier installation and maintenance on building facades and highways.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm compare to other outdoor LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to alternatives, it offers superior brightness (7,000 nits) and weather resistance (IP65 F&R), along with advanced thermal management for reliable operation in harsh GCC climates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical lifespan of this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The product boasts up to 100,000 operational hours, ensuring long-term durability and a strong return on investment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the average power consumption of the display per square meter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It consumes an average power of 520W per square meter, balancing high brightness with energy efficiency.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty offered with the Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Warranty terms vary; please contact Brightluxx sales for detailed information on coverage and duration specific to your purchase.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which applications are best suited for this LED display product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display excels in outdoor environments such as building facades and highway digital out-of-home (DOOH) advertising, due to its high visibility and durability.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Outdoor Brilliance 3.9mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx390\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\